2026-08-25T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-1125) 'ASD-STE100 exists so a maintenance technician reading in their second language
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1125  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-1125) 'can take a procedure and act on it correctly the first time. Every constraint it
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1125  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:33Z (RFD66606-1125) 'carries serves that: bounded sentences, one approved term per referent, no
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1125  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:34Z (RFD66606-1125) 'contractions, no ambiguity about what a pronoun points at. Applied to a schema
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1125  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-1125) 'table or an install step, those constraints are exactly right.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1125  1 LINE
 Text:Written

