 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1125  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:38Z (RFD66606-1125) 'persuades through how its reasons sit against each other, and a controlled
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1125  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:39Z (RFD66606-1125) 'vocabulary flattens that into a list of assertions. The reader loses the ability
 # tags: rfd:details
